    "##### DMI Estimation\n",
    "\n",
    "Estimations are different for lactating cows and dry cows. For details about the variables included in each calculation, please refer to @tbl-an-dmi-var. The sum of DMI of each feed is assumed to be less than the estimated DMI:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\sum_{i} \\text{Feed}_{i} < \\text{DMIest}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Lactating Cows** <br>\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-nrc-51}\n",
    "[[**AN.NRC.51**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{FCM} = (0.4 \\times \\text{Milk}) + (15 \\times \\text{Fat\\_Milk} \\times \\frac{\\text{Milk}}{100})\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-nrc-52}\n",
    "[[**AN.NRC.52**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DMIest} = (0.372 \\times \\text{FCM} + 0.0968 \\times \\text{BW}^{0.75}) \\times (1 - e^{(-0.192 \\times \\text{WOL} + 3.67)})\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dry Cows** <br>\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-nrc-53}\n",
    "[[**AN.NRC.53**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DMIest} = (\\frac{1.97 - 0.75 \\times e^{0.16 \\times (\\text{DOP} - 280)}}{100}) \\times \\text{BW}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Heifers** <br>\n",
    "\n",
    "* If the heifer is *LESS* than 365 days old:\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-nrc-54}\n",
    "[[**AN.NRC.54**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DMIest} = (\\text{BW}^{0.75} \\times \\frac{(0.2435 \\times \\text{NEadj}) - (0.0466 \\times \\text{NEadj}^{2}) - 0.0869}{\\text{NEadj}}) - \\text{PREGadj}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "* If the heifer is *MORE* than 365 days old:\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-nrc-55}\n",
    "[[**AN.NRC.55**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DMIest} = (\\text{BW}^{0.75} \\times \\frac{(0.2435 \\times \\text{NEadj}) - (0.0466 \\times \\text{NEadj}^{2}) - 0.1128}{\\text{NEadj}}) - \\text{PREGadj}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::"
   ]
  },
