   "source": [
    "**Total Digestible Nutrients (TDN)**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-1-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.1.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{TDNconc} = \\frac{\\text{TotalTDN}}{\\text{DMI}} \\times 100\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-2-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.2.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DMI\\_to\\_maint} = 1, if \\text{TotalTDN} < 0.035 \\times \\text{BW}^{0.75}, \\frac{\\text{TotalTDN}}{0.035 \\times \\text{SBW}^{0.75}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "Otherwise:\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-3-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.3.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Discount} = 1, \\quad if \\quad \\text{TDNconc} < 60 \\frac{\\text{TDNconc} - (0.18 \\times \\text{TDNconc} - 10.3) \\times (\\text{DMI}_{\\text{to,maint}} - 1)}{\\text{TDNconc}}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-4-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.4.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{TDNact}_{\\text{i}} = \\text{TDN}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{Discount}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Digestible Energy (DE)**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-4}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.4**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DEact}_{\\text{i}} = \\text{DE}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{Discount}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Metabolizable Energy (ME)**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-5-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.5.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{MEacti} =\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "(1.01 \\times \\text{DEacti}) + (0.0046 \\times 0.0046 \\times \\text{EEi}) - 3,& \\text{if feed type is not fat and fat content is} \\geq3\\% \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(1.01 \\times \\text{DEacti}) - 0.45,& \\text{if feed type is not fat and fat content is} \\leq3\\% \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(1.01 \\times \\text{DEacti}),& \\text{if feed type is fat}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Net Energy**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Maintenance\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-7-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.7.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{NEmacti} =\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "(1.37 \\times \\text{MEacti}) - (0.138 \\times \\text{MEacti}^2) + (0.0105 \\times \\text{MEacti}^3) - 1.12 ,& \\text{if feed type is not fat} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(0.8 \\times \\text{MEacti}) ,& \\text{if feed type is fat} \n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "* Lactation\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-6-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.6.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{NElacti}=\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "(0.703 \\times \\text{MEacti}) - 0.019 + (0.097 \\times \\text{MEacti}) + (0.1997 \\times \\text{EEi}) - 3 ,& \\text{if feed type is not fat and fat content is} \\geq3\\% \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(0.703 \\times \\text{MEacti}) - 0.19 ,& \\text{if feed type is not fat and fat content is} \\leq3\\% \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(0.8 \\times \\text{0DEacti}) ,& \\text{if feed type is fat}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "* Activity\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-8-1}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.8.1**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{NEgacti}\n",
    "=\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "(1.42 \\times \\text{MEacti}) - (0.174 \\times \\text{MEacti}^2) + (0.0122 \\times \\text{MEacti}^3) - 1.65 ,& \\text{if feed type is not fat} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "(0.55 \\times \\text{MEacti}) ,& \\text{if feed type is fat} \n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "##### Energy Supply: NASEM\n",
    "\n",
    "Energy supply in the updated 2021 Nutrient Requirement model [@nrc_2021] is estimated based only on the NEl and follows a simplified estimation method when compared \n",
    "to the 2001 model [@nrc_2001].\n",
    "\n",
    "First, the digestible energy of each feed is estimated based on the nutrient content and the estimated digestibility of that nutrient.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-1-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.1.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "\\text{DE}_i &= (0.042 \\times \\text{NDF}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{dNDF}_{\\text{i}}) + (0.0423 \\times \\text{Starch}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{dStarch}_{\\text{i}}) \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "& \\qquad + (0.0940 \\times \\text{FA}_i \\times \\text{dFA}_{\\text{i}}) + (0.0565 \\times (\\text{RDP}_{\\text{i}} + (\\text{RUP}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{dRUP}_{\\text{i}})- \\text{NPN}_{\\text{supp, i}})) \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "& \\qquad  + (0.0089 \\times \\text{NPN}_{\\text{supp, i}}) + (0.040 \\times \\text{ROM}_{\\text{i}} \\times \\text{dROM}_{\\text{i}}) - 0.318\n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "    \n",
    "Parameter definitions and units are provided in @tbl-an-energy-nasem. "
   ]
