  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "972e90c3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The nutrient compositions of each feed ($\\text{NDF}_\\text{i}$, $\\text{Starch}_\\text{i}$, $\\text{EE}_\\text{i}$, $\\text{RUP}_\\text{i}$) are provided in the feed library. \n",
    "The digestibilities of each feed are estimated to account for the effects of intake and diet composition:\n",
    "\n",
    "**Digestible Energy (DE) of a Feed**\n",
    "\n",
    "* Neutral Detergent Fiber Digestibility (dNDF)\n",
    "\n",
    "The digestibility of NDF is adjusted from the base NDF digestibility of the feed to account for the effect of total DMI and starch intake. \n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{dNDF}_\\text{i} = (\\text{dNDF}_\\text{base,i} - (0.0059 \\times \\text{Starch}_\\text{Diet}) - 0.26)  - 1.1 \\times (\\frac{\\text{DMI}}{\\text{BodyWeight}} - 0.035)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "And the $\\text{dNDF}_\\text{base,i}$ is calculated based on the lignin and NDF content of the feed.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-2-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.2.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{dNDF}_\\text{i} = \\frac{0.75 \\times (\\text{NDF}_{\\text i} - \\text{Lignin}_{\\text i}) \\times (1-(\\frac{\\text{Lignin}_\\text{i}}{\\text{NDF}_{\\text i}})^{0.667})}{\\text{NDF}_\\text{i}} \n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::    \n",
    "\n",
    "* Starch Digestibility (dStarch)\n",
    "\n",
    "Similarly, the digestibility of starch is adjusted for the level of intake from a base digestibility: \n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-3-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.3.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{dStarch}_\\text{i} = \\text{dStarch}_\\text{base,i} - 1.0 \\times (\\frac{\\text{DMI}}{\\text{BW}} - 0.035) \n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::  \n",
    "\n",
    "And the base starch digestibility, $\\text{dStarch}_\\text{base,i}$, is considered to be an innate property of the feed and is provided in the feed library.\n",
    "\n",
    "* Fatty Acid Digestibility (dFA)\n",
    "\n",
    "Fatty acids are assumed to have a digestibility of 0.73 $(\\text{dFA}_\\text{i} = 0.73)$ unless a digesibility specific to the fat supplement is provided by the manufacturer.\n",
    "\n",
    "* Protein Digestibility (RUP and dRUP)\n",
    "\n",
    "The rumen degradable protein (RDP) content of a feed is calculated as the proportion of crude protein (CP) that is not considered to be rumen undegradable (RUP). Thus: \n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-4-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.4.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\begin{aligned}\n",
    "& \\text{RDP}_\\text{i} = \\frac{1 - \\text{RUP}_\\text{CP,i}}{\\text{CP}_\\text{i}} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "& \\text{RDP}_\\text{i} = \\frac{\\text{RUP}_\\text{CP,i}}{\\text{CP}_\\text{i}} \n",
    "\\end{aligned}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "* Residual Organic Matter (ROM)\n",
    "\n",
    "The Residual Organic Matter (ROM) fraction of a feed is calculated by difference as the following:\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-5-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.5.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{ROM}_\\text{i} = 1 - \\frac{\\text{FA}_\\text{i}}{1.06} - \\text{Ash}_\\text{i} - \\text{NDF}_\\text{i} - \\text{Starch}_\\text{i} - (\\text{CP}_\\text{i} - 0.64 \\times \\text{NPN}_\\text{supp,i})\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "The digestibility of ROM is assumed to be 0.96 $(\\text{dROM}_\\text{i} = 0.96)$ and $\\text{NPN}_\\text{supp,i}$ is the supplemented non-protein nitrogen fraction as a proportion of the total CP content. \n",
    "\n",
    "**Digestible Energy of the Diet**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-6-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.6.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{DE}_\\text{Diet} = \\sum^{n}_{i=1} \\text{DE}_\\text{i} \\times \\text{PropFeed}_\\text{i}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "**Metabolizable Energy**\n",
    "\n",
    "The dietary ME is calculated by subtracting the energy found in gaseous losses (i.e. enteric methane) and the energy lost in urine from the total diet digestible energy. \n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-7-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.7.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{ME}_\\text{Diet} = \\text{DE}_\\text{Diet} - \\text{GaseEnergy} - \\text{UrineEnergy}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "* Gaseous Energy\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-8-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.8.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{GasEnergy} = 13.28 \\times \\text{EntericMethane}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "* Urine Energy\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-9-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.9.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{UrineEnergy} = 0.0146 \\times \\text{UrinaryNitrogen}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "where GasEnergy and UrineEnergy are in units of Mcal/d, EntericMethane is in units of kg/d, and UrinaryNitrogen is in units of g/d.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Net Energy**\n",
    "\n",
    "Net energy is simply estimated as metabolizable energy used at an average efficiency of 0.66.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-10-2}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.10.2**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{NEl} = 0.66 \\times \\text{ME}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "##### Protein Supply\n",
    "\n",
    "Protein supply from the feed includes 3 parts: digestible RUP, digestible MCP, which is produced through RDP, and endogenous protein supply from sloughed cells and enzyme secretion into the gut lumen. MCP production requires a nitrogen source and an energy source, so MCP is either nitrogen-limited (when energy is sufficient) or energy-limited (when nitrogen is sufficient). Minerals do not provide any protein.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-14}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.14**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{MP}_\\text{supply} = \\text{MP}_\\text{bac} + \\text{RUP}_\\text{diet} + \\text{EndP}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "::: \n",
    "\n",
    "**Microbial Protein Supply**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-9}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.9**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Kpi} =\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "2.904 + (1.375 \\times \\frac{\\text{DMI}}{\\text{BW}} \\times 100) - (0.02 \\times \\text{PercentConc}) ,& \\text{if feed is concentrate} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "3.362 + (0.479 \\times \\frac{\\text{DMI}}{\\text{BW}} \\times 100) - (0.17 \\times \\text{NDF}_\\text{i}) - (0.007 \\times \\text{PercentConc}) ,& \\text{if feed is forage} \\\\[8pt]\n",
    "3.054 + (0.614 \\times \\frac{\\text{DMI}}{\\text{BW}} \\times 100) ,& \\text{if feed is wet forage}\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-10}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.10**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{RDPi} =\n",
    "\\begin{cases}\n",
    "(\\frac{\\text{Kdi}}{\\text{Kdi + Kpi}} \\times \\frac{\\text{NBi}}{100} \\times \\text{CPi}) + (\\frac{\\text{NAi}}{100} \\times \\text{CPi}) ,& \\text{if Kpi + Kdi} > 0 \\\\[6pt]\n",
    "0 ,& \\text{if Kpi + Kdi} \\leq 0 \\\\\n",
    "\\end{cases}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-11}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.11**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{MPbact} = 0.64 \\times min(1000 \\times 0.13 \\times \\text{TDNact}_\\text{diet}, 1000 \\times 0.85 \\times \\text{RDP}_\\text{diet})\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Rumen Undegradable Protein Supply**\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-12}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.12**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{RUP}_\\text{i} = \\text{CP}_\\text{i} - \\text{RDP}_\\text{i}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-13}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.13**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{RUP}_\\text{i} = \\sum_i\\text{Feed}_\\text{i} \\times \\text{RUP}_\\text{i} - \\text{dRDP}_\\text{i}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "**Endogenous Protein Supply**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{EndP} = 0.4 \\times 11.8 \\times \\text{DMI}\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "##### Mineral Supply\n",
    "\n",
    "We will use calcium as an example, but phosphorus calculations will be similar.\n",
    "\n",
    ":::{#eq-an-sup-15}\n",
    "[[**AN.SUP.15**]]{.aside .content-visible when-format=\"html\"}    \n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{Ca}_\\text{supply} = \\sum_i\\text{Feed}_\\text{i} \\times \\text{Ca}_\\text{i} \\times \\frac{\\text{dCa}_\\text{i}}{100}\n",
    "$$\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Automated Ration Formulation\n",
